<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>
/* Typewriter subtitle template.

   ALL animation timings are derived from subtitles.json — no magic numbers.

   Cues are grouped by the same punctuation boundaries as the other
   subtitles-* examples (6 cues from the 21 word entries).

   1) Per-cue timing
      A cue groups the word entries between two natural punctuation breaks.
        cue.animation-delay     = first_word.timing[0]
        cue.animation-duration  = last_word.timing[1] - first_word.timing[0]
      Cue visibility uses the standard step-opacity pattern (snap on at delay,
      hold, snap off at end), no fade — same as the other -cues / -karaoke /
      -advanced examples.

   2) Per-character timing (INSIDE a cue)
      Each word's characters are spread evenly across that word's speak
      window:
        for word with text of length n and timing [w_start, w_end]:
          char i (0-based) reveals at  w_start + (i / n) * (w_end - w_start)
      The space character BETWEEN words reveals at the next word's w_start.
      So characters of a fast word ("sind", 4 chars in 0.186s) flash in
      quickly; characters of a slow one ("überhaupt.", 10 chars in 1.039s)
      trickle in leisurely — matching the speaker's actual cadence.

   To re-derive the body after subtitles.json changes: regenerate the per-cue
   and per-character spans from examples/subtitles/subtitles.json using the
   two rules above (grouping into 6 cues by punctuation, then spreading
   characters evenly across each word's [w_start, w_end] window).

   Layout notes:
   - The cue is a flex container in a 70% center safe-zone (15% gutter each
     side), flex-wrap:wrap + justify-content:center — same box as the other
     subtitles-* examples. Long cues WRAP within the safe zone instead of
     overflowing the frame.
   - Each WORD is a flex item (.word, white-space:nowrap) holding that word's
     per-character .ch spans glued together. Wrapping happens only at word
     boundaries (flex items), never mid-word.
   - Per-character reveal stays stable: every word flex-item is always present
     and occupies its slot from frame 0 (only .ch opacity animates), so chars
     appearing never reflow the line.
   - Inter-word spacing is the flex column-gap, so there are no inter-word
     space spans (and no dependency on inter-span whitespace).
   - No filter:drop-shadow -> the partial-opacity glyph-clip bug doesn't
     trigger.
*/
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cabin+Sketch:wght@400;700&display=swap');
html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
body{width:576px;height:1024px;background:#000;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  font-family:'Cabin Sketch',cursive;text-align:center;color:#fff}
video{position:absolute;inset:0;width:576px;height:1024px;object-fit:cover}

.cue{position:absolute;left:15%;width:70%;top:62%;
  font-size:30px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;row-gap:6px;column-gap:9px;
  opacity:0;
  animation-name:cueshow;animation-timing-function:linear;animation-fill-mode:forwards}
@keyframes cueshow{
  0%, 99.99% { opacity:1 }
  100% { opacity:0 }
}

.word{white-space:nowrap}
.ch{display:inline;
  opacity:0;
  animation-name:reveal;
  animation-duration:0.05s;
  animation-timing-function:linear;
  animation-fill-mode:forwards}
@keyframes reveal{
  from { opacity:0 }
  to   { opacity:1 }
}
</style></head><body>
  <video src="../../assets/videos/dude.mp4" muted></video>

  <!-- 139 char spans across 6 cues; timings derived from subtitles.json word windows -->

  <!-- Cue 1: "Ehrlich gesagt,"  [0.240, 1.040] dur=0.800s -->
  <div class="cue" style="animation-delay:0.240s;animation-duration:0.800s">
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.240s">E</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.289s">h</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.337s">r</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.386s">l</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.434s">i</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.483s">c</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.531s">h</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.580s">g</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.646s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.711s">s</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.777s">a</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.843s">g</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.909s">t</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:0.974s">,</span></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Cue 2: "Sonntagmorgen sind das Beste überhaupt."  [1.041, 3.600] dur=2.559s -->
  <div class="cue" style="animation-delay:1.041s;animation-duration:2.559s">
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.041s">S</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.102s">o</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.164s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.225s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.287s">t</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.348s">a</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.410s">g</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.471s">m</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.533s">o</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.594s">r</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.656s">g</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.717s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.779s">n</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.841s">s</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.887s">i</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.934s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:1.981s">d</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.027s">d</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.087s">a</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.147s">s</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.207s">B</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.278s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.348s">s</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.419s">t</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.489s">e</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.561s">ü</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.665s">b</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.769s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.873s">r</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:2.977s">h</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:3.080s">a</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:3.184s">u</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:3.288s">p</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:3.392s">t</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:3.496s">.</span></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Cue 3: "Kein Handy, keine Planen,"  [3.601, 5.441] dur=1.840s -->
  <div class="cue" style="animation-delay:3.601s;animation-duration:1.840s">
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:3.601s">K</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:3.711s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:3.821s">i</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:3.931s">n</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.041s">H</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.114s">a</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.188s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.261s">d</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.334s">y</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.408s">,</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.481s">k</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.569s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.657s">i</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.744s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.832s">e</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.921s">P</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:4.995s">l</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.070s">a</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.144s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.218s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.292s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.367s">,</span></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Cue 4: "einfach nur Ruhe,"  [5.441, 7.221] dur=1.780s -->
  <div class="cue" style="animation-delay:5.441s;animation-duration:1.780s">
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.441s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.515s">i</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.590s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.664s">f</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.738s">a</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.812s">c</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.887s">h</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:5.961s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:6.134s">u</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:6.307s">r</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:6.481s">R</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:6.629s">u</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:6.777s">h</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:6.925s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.073s">,</span></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Cue 5: "langsamer Kaffee, gutes Buch"  [7.221, 10.160] dur=2.939s -->
  <div class="cue" style="animation-delay:7.221s;animation-duration:2.939s">
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.221s">l</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.303s">a</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.385s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.467s">g</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.549s">s</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.632s">a</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.714s">m</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.796s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.878s">r</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:7.961s">K</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:8.066s">a</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:8.170s">f</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:8.275s">f</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:8.380s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:8.485s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:8.589s">,</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:8.694s">g</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:8.841s">u</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:8.987s">t</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:9.134s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:9.280s">s</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:9.427s">B</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:9.610s">u</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:9.793s">c</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:9.977s">h</span></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Cue 6: "und los geht's."  [10.880, 12.041] dur=1.161s -->
  <div class="cue" style="animation-delay:10.880s;animation-duration:1.161s">
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:10.880s">u</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.009s">n</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.138s">d</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.267s">l</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.396s">o</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.525s">s</span></span>
    <span class="word"><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.654s">g</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.709s">e</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.765s">h</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.820s">t</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.875s">&apos;</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.930s">s</span><span class="ch" style="animation-delay:11.986s">.</span></span>
  </div>
</body></html>
